title: "DimSpin"
abstract: "EPR/ESR spectrum simulator for spin Hamiltonians and spin-electric coupling (SEC) tensors, featuring electric-field modulation (EFM), magnetic-field modulation (MFM), and 2D angle-dependent single-crystal analysis."
